ture is present on only a few slices and appears roughly spherical. The estimated diameter is 3 mm.\n\nLet's try to focus. I'm going to look at the center of image 4, 5, and 6. I'm seeing a very faint, slightly brighter area in the exact center that appears in a few slices. It doesn't seem to move much, so I'm going to go with \"Nodule\" again. The reasoning is that it's a focal, roughly spherical opacity that doesn't track like a vessel. The diameter is very small, maybe 1/20th of the image width, about 3mm. Okay, I'm confident with this assessment.\n\n\n",
